// What cc1 keeps in its CodeGenOptions but the preprocessor, Sema or the driver
// read too: MIPS's MSA (__mips_msa); the integrated assembler, without which
// ARM keeps crypto an M-profile architecture lacks (__ARM_FEATURE_AES); the LTO
// unit splitting, unified LTO and cross-DSO CFI, which -fsanitize=cfi checks
// and expands by; the exception model (__SEH__, __USING_SJLJ_EXCEPTIONS__); CFI
// directives (__GCC_HAVE_DWARF2_CFI_ASM); the instrumentation profile
// (__LLVM_INSTR_PROFILE_GENERATE, __LLVM_INSTR_PROFILE_USE); the coverage
// sanitizer (__has_feature(coverage_sanitizer)); the vtables Sema marks used;
// speculative load hardening's __has_feature; the vector library
